#: includes/protect/class-security-updates.php:170
msgid "Security updates turned on for every plugin with a known vulnerability."
msgstr "Actualizaciones de seguridad activadas para todos los plugins con una vulnerabilidad conocida."

#: includes/protect/class-security-updates.php:171
msgid "Security updates turned off for every plugin with a known vulnerability."
msgstr "Actualizaciones de seguridad desactivadas para todos los plugins con una vulnerabilidad conocida."

#: includes/protect/class-security-updates.php:713
msgid "A plugin has a known security fix that WordPress did not list yet, so ShieldWave asked WordPress to check for plugin updates now."
msgstr "Un plugin tiene una corrección de seguridad conocida que WordPress aún no muestra, así que ShieldWave pidió a WordPress que buscara actualizaciones de plugins ahora."

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:141
msgid "File cleanup"
msgstr "Limpieza de archivos"

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:143
msgid "File repair"
msgstr "Reparación de archivos"

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:149
msgid "Ignoring issues and resetting the baseline"
msgstr "Ignorar problemas y restablecer la referencia"

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:151
msgid "Activity history tools"
msgstr "Herramientas del historial de actividad"

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:153
msgid "Site checks and the test email"
msgstr "Comprobaciones del sitio y correo de prueba"

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:155
msgid "Connecting to shieldwave.io"
msgstr "Conexión con shieldwave.io"

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:261
msgid "A change to the parts of the plugin the threat feed switched off was not saved, because it did not come from the signed feed."
msgstr "No se guardó un cambio en las partes del plugin que la fuente de amenazas desactivó, porque no venía de la fuente firmada."

#. translators: 1: part of the plugin, e.g. "Quarantine"; 2: advisory id, e.g.
#. SWA-2027-001; 3: plugin version.
#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:429
msgid "%1$s is switched off on this site because of advisory %2$s, until Ensomedia Security %3$s or later is installed. Update the plugin on the Plugins screen."
msgstr "La función «%1$s» está desactivada en este sitio por el aviso %2$s, hasta que se instale Ensomedia Security %3$s o posterior. Actualiza el plugin en la pantalla Plugins."

#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:452
#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:481
msgid "Switched off until the plugin is updated"
msgstr "Desactivado hasta que se actualice el plugin"

#. translators: 1: advisory id; 2: plugin version.
#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:476
msgid "Signing in with a passkey is switched off on this site because of advisory %1$s, until Ensomedia Security %2$s or later is installed. Sign in with your password and your authenticator app or a backup code."
msgstr "El acceso con llave de acceso está desactivado en este sitio por el aviso %1$s, hasta que se instale Ensomedia Security %2$s o posterior. Accede con tu contraseña y tu aplicación de autenticación o un código de respaldo."

#. translators: 1: advisory id; 2: advisory title; 3: comma-separated parts of
#. the plugin; 4: plugin version.
#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:568
msgid "Advisory %1$s (%2$s): the signed threat feed switched off these parts of Ensomedia Security because of a flaw in them: %3$s. The rest of the plugin keeps working. They come back on by themselves once version %4$s or later is installed, so update the plugin."
msgstr "Aviso %1$s (%2$s): la fuente de amenazas firmada desactivó estas partes de Ensomedia Security por un fallo en ellas: %3$s. El resto del plugin sigue funcionando. Se vuelven a activar solas cuando se instale la versión %4$s o posterior, así que actualiza el plugin."

#. translators: 1: comma-separated parts of the plugin; 2: comma-separated
#. advisory ids.
#: includes/protect/class-self-switch.php:618
msgid "Back on: %1$s. Advisory %2$s no longer applies to this site."
msgstr "Activo de nuevo: %1$s. El aviso %2$s ya no afecta a este sitio."

#: includes/class-schedule.php:115
msgid "Every 15 minutes"
msgstr "Cada 15 minutos"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-vpatch.php:94
msgid "Block critical virtual patches automatically"
msgstr "Bloquear automáticamente los parches virtuales críticos"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-vpatch.php:95
msgid "A critical patch that the ShieldWave review marked safe to block refuses matching requests as soon as it arrives. Other patches start in record-only mode. What you set for a single patch below always wins."
msgstr "Un parche crítico que la revisión de ShieldWave marcó como seguro para bloquear rechaza las solicitudes que coinciden en cuanto llega. Los demás parches empiezan en modo solo registro. Lo que configures abajo para un parche concreto siempre tiene prioridad."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-vpatch.php:163
msgid "Block, automatic for critical patches"
msgstr "Bloquear, automático para parches críticos"

#: includes/protect/class-vpatch-switch.php:532
msgid "Critical virtual patches marked safe to block now block the matching requests from the start."
msgstr "Los parches virtuales críticos marcados como seguros para bloquear ahora bloquean las solicitudes que coinciden desde el principio."

#: includes/protect/class-vpatch-switch.php:533
msgid "Critical virtual patches no longer block automatically. Each one follows the mode you set for it."
msgstr "Los parches virtuales críticos ya no bloquean automáticamente. Cada uno sigue el modo que configures para él."

#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1016
msgid "Cloudflare asked to slow down, so the plugin waits before it tries again."
msgstr "Cloudflare pidió ir más despacio, así que el plugin espera antes de volver a intentarlo."

#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1020
msgid "Cloudflare could not be reached. The plugin tries again later."
msgstr "No se pudo conectar con Cloudflare. El plugin vuelve a intentarlo más tarde."

#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1018
msgid "Cloudflare did not accept the change."
msgstr "Cloudflare no aceptó el cambio."

#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1014
msgid "Cloudflare refused the token. Check that it is active and has Zone WAF Edit and Zone Read for the zone of this site."
msgstr "Cloudflare rechazó el token. Comprueba que esté activo y que tenga Zone WAF Edit y Zone Read para la zona de este sitio."

#. translators: 1: edge rule id, 2: Cloudflare zone name.
#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1077
msgid "Edge rule %1$s was added to the Cloudflare zone %2$s."
msgstr "La regla edge %1$s se añadió a la zona de Cloudflare %2$s."

#. translators: 1: edge rule id, 2: Cloudflare zone name.
#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1083
msgid "Edge rule %1$s was removed from the Cloudflare zone %2$s."
msgstr "La regla edge %1$s se quitó de la zona de Cloudflare %2$s."

#. translators: 1: edge rule id, 2: Cloudflare zone name.
#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1080
msgid "Edge rule %1$s was updated in the Cloudflare zone %2$s."
msgstr "La regla edge %1$s se actualizó en la zona de Cloudflare %2$s."

#. translators: %s: what went wrong.
#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:1052
msgid "Edge rules could not be updated in Cloudflare: %s"
msgstr "No se pudieron actualizar las reglas edge en Cloudflare: %s"

#. translators: 1: PHP version of the site, 2: first fixed PHP version.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:217
msgid "For your host: this site runs PHP %1$s. php2shell is fixed in PHP %2$s. Please update, or confirm the fix is already in your PHP build."
msgstr "Para tu proveedor de hosting: este sitio usa PHP %1$s. php2shell está corregido en PHP %2$s. Por favor, actualiza o confirma que la corrección ya está en tu compilación de PHP."

#. translators: %s: PHP version of the site.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:205
msgid "This site runs PHP %s, which by its version number is not below the php2shell fix."
msgstr "Este sitio usa PHP %s, que por su número de versión no es anterior a la corrección de php2shell."

#. translators: %s: host name of the site.
#: includes/protect/class-edge-rules.php:869
msgid "This token cannot see a Cloudflare zone for %s. Check that the token is for the zone of this site and has Zone Read."
msgstr "Este token no ve ninguna zona de Cloudflare para %s. Comprueba que el token sea de la zona de este sitio y tenga Zone Read."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:200
msgid "php2shell (CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619) is a flaw in PHP that is triggered while PHP reads a request, before any plugin runs. The attack uses form uploads that look like ordinary ones from outside, so a rule here could not stop it without blocking real uploads, and none is offered. Cloudflare says its own managed rules for it are on for every plan, Free included. The fix is a PHP update by your host."
msgstr "php2shell (CVE-2026-109618 y CVE-2026-109619) es un fallo de PHP que se activa mientras PHP lee una solicitud, antes de que se ejecute ningún plugin. El ataque usa subidas de formularios que desde fuera parecen normales, así que una regla aquí no podría detenerlo sin bloquear subidas reales, y no se ofrece ninguna. Cloudflare dice que sus propias reglas gestionadas para esto están activas en todos los planes, Free incluido. La solución es una actualización de PHP por parte de tu proveedor de hosting."

#: includes/class-php2shell-alert.php:91
msgid "My host confirmed the fix is installed: hide this"
msgstr "Mi hosting confirmó que la corrección está instalada: ocultar"

#. translators: %s: PHP version.
#: includes/class-php2shell-alert.php:93
msgid "Hidden for PHP %s only. It comes back if the PHP version changes."
msgstr "Oculto solo para PHP %s. Vuelve a aparecer si cambia la versión de PHP."

#. translators: %s: PHP version.
#: includes/class-php2shell-alert.php:109
msgid "php2shell warning hidden for PHP %s: the host confirmed the fix."
msgstr "Aviso de php2shell oculto para PHP %s: el hosting confirmó la corrección."

#: includes/class-php2shell-alert.php:128
msgid "PHP may need a restart"
msgstr "Puede que haya que reiniciar PHP"

#: includes/class-php2shell-alert.php:128
msgid "This page was served by a PHP process that still runs a program file or library which has since been replaced on disk. This usually means PHP was updated without a restart, so the update does not apply to this process yet. Ask your host to restart PHP (PHP-FPM or LiteSpeed). This does not show whether the php2shell fix is installed, and only this one process was checked."
msgstr "Esta página la sirvió un proceso de PHP que todavía usa un archivo de programa o una biblioteca que ya se ha sustituido en el disco. Normalmente significa que PHP se actualizó sin reiniciarlo, así que la actualización aún no se aplica a este proceso. Pide a tu proveedor de alojamiento que reinicie PHP (PHP-FPM o LiteSpeed). Esto no indica si la corrección de php2shell está instalada, y solo se ha comprobado este proceso."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/group.php:294
msgid "Covers every plugin that has a known vulnerability, not only this one. A release is installed only when it fixes a vulnerability of the version you have, the same way as when you choose one plugin. It is off until you turn it on."
msgstr "Cubre todos los plugins con una vulnerabilidad conocida, no solo este. Una versión se instala únicamente si corrige una vulnerabilidad de la versión que tienes, igual que al elegir un solo plugin. Está desactivado hasta que lo actives."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/group.php:296
msgid "Turn off security updates for all plugins"
msgstr "Desactivar las actualizaciones de seguridad de todos los plugins"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/group.php:296
msgid "Install security fixes for all vulnerable plugins automatically"
msgstr "Instalar automáticamente las correcciones de seguridad de todos los plugins vulnerables"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:80
msgid "A token is saved. Leave the field empty to keep it."
msgstr "Hay un token guardado. Deja el campo vacío para conservarlo."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:48
msgid "An edge rule stops requests with a known shape of an attack before they reach your server. It does not stop an attack that looks like a normal request, a new variant, or a request sent straight to your server past Cloudflare. Updating PHP and plugins is the fix. An edge rule buys time."
msgstr "Una regla edge detiene las solicitudes con una forma de ataque conocida antes de que lleguen a tu servidor. No detiene un ataque que parece una solicitud normal, una variante nueva ni una solicitud enviada directamente a tu servidor sin pasar por Cloudflare. La solución es actualizar PHP y los plugins. Una regla edge gana tiempo."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:69
msgid "Adds the rules for this site to the custom rules of your zone, removes them when they no longer apply, and removes all of them when you turn this off or delete the plugin. Only rules whose description starts with \"ShieldWave:\" are touched. Cloudflare receives the token, the site's host name and the rules. Nothing goes to shieldwave.io."
msgstr "Añade las reglas de este sitio a las reglas personalizadas de tu zona, las quita cuando ya no se aplican y las quita todas cuando desactivas esto o eliminas el plugin. Solo se tocan las reglas cuya descripción empieza por \"ShieldWave:\". Cloudflare recibe el token, el nombre de host del sitio y las reglas. No se envía nada a shieldwave.io."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:78
msgid "Cloudflare API token"
msgstr "Token de API de Cloudflare"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:135
msgid "Cloudflare allows 5 custom rules on Free, 20 on Pro and 100 on Business, your own rules included."
msgstr "Cloudflare permite 5 reglas personalizadas en Free, 20 en Pro y 100 en Business, incluidas tus propias reglas."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:93
msgid "Create the token, copy it and paste it here. Cloudflare shows it only once."
msgstr "Crea el token, cópialo y pégalo aquí. Cloudflare lo muestra solo una vez."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:199
msgid "Flaws in PHP itself"
msgstr "Fallos del propio PHP"

#. translators: 1: PHP version of the site, 2: first fixed PHP version.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:173
msgid "For your host: this site runs PHP %1$s. The flaw is fixed in PHP %2$s."
msgstr "Para tu proveedor de hosting: este sitio usa PHP %1$s. El fallo está corregido en PHP %2$s."

#. translators: %s: PHP version of the site.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:176
msgid "For your host: this site runs PHP %s, a branch that gets no fix. Move the site to a supported PHP version."
msgstr "Para tu proveedor de hosting: este sitio usa PHP %s, una rama que no recibe corrección. Pasa el sitio a una versión de PHP compatible."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:88
msgid "How to make the token"
msgstr "Cómo crear el token"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:90
msgid "In Cloudflare, open My Profile, then API Tokens, and choose Create Token, then Create Custom Token."
msgstr "En Cloudflare, abre My Profile, luego API Tokens, y elige Create Token y después Create Custom Token."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:68
msgid "Keep edge rules in Cloudflare"
msgstr "Mantener reglas edge en Cloudflare"

#. translators: %s: what went wrong.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:143
msgid "Last problem: %s"
msgstr "Último problema: %s"

#. translators: %s: plugin folder name.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:182
msgid "No fixed release of %s exists yet."
msgstr "Todavía no existe una versión corregida de %s."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:123
msgid "No rule of this plugin is in the zone."
msgstr "Ninguna regla de este plugin está en la zona."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:91
msgid "Permissions: Zone, Zone WAF, Edit. Add a second line: Zone, Zone, Read."
msgstr "Permisos: Zone, Zone WAF, Edit. Añade una segunda línea: Zone, Zone, Read."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:85
msgid "Remove the token. The plugin removes its rules from Cloudflare first."
msgstr "Elimina el token. El plugin quita antes sus reglas de Cloudflare."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:159
msgid "Rules for this site"
msgstr "Reglas para este sitio"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated edge rule ids.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:122
msgid "Rules this plugin keeps in the zone: %s."
msgstr "Reglas que este plugin mantiene en la zona: %s."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:42
msgid "Some flaws are in PHP itself or are reached before WordPress loads, so no plugin can stop them. A firewall in front of the site can stop some of them. With a Cloudflare API token, the plugin keeps rules for the flaws that concern this site in your Cloudflare zone. Off until you turn it on."
msgstr "Algunos fallos están en el propio PHP o se alcanzan antes de que cargue WordPress, así que ningún plugin puede detenerlos. Un cortafuegos delante del sitio puede detener algunos. Con un token de API de Cloudflare, el plugin mantiene en tu zona de Cloudflare reglas para los fallos que afectan a este sitio. Desactivado hasta que lo actives."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:161
msgid "The threat feed has no edge rule for the PHP version or the plugins of this site."
msgstr "La fuente de amenazas no tiene ninguna regla edge para la versión de PHP ni para los plugins de este sitio."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:52
msgid "This page was requested from a Cloudflare address, so the site looks to be behind Cloudflare."
msgstr "Esta página se solicitó desde una dirección de Cloudflare, así que el sitio parece estar detrás de Cloudflare."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:54
msgid "This page was requested with a Cloudflare header, so the site may be behind Cloudflare."
msgstr "Esta página se solicitó con una cabecera de Cloudflare, así que el sitio puede estar detrás de Cloudflare."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:56
msgid "This page was requested without any sign of Cloudflare. Edge rules work only when visitors reach the site through Cloudflare."
msgstr "Esta página se solicitó sin ninguna señal de Cloudflare. Las reglas edge solo funcionan cuando los visitantes llegan al sitio a través de Cloudflare."

#. translators: %s: Cloudflare action name, such as Block.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:190
msgid "To add it by hand: in Cloudflare open Security, then WAF, then Custom rules. Create a rule, choose Edit expression, paste this and choose the action %s."
msgstr "Para añadirla a mano: en Cloudflare abre Security, luego WAF, luego Custom rules. Crea una regla, elige Edit expression, pega esto y elige la acción %s."

#. translators: 1: plugin folder name, 2: installed version, 3: first fixed
#. version.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:179
msgid "Update %1$s from %2$s to %3$s or newer."
msgstr "Actualiza %1$s de %2$s a %3$s o posterior."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:153
msgid "Update Cloudflare now"
msgstr "Actualizar Cloudflare ahora"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:47
msgid "What the edge can and cannot block"
msgstr "Lo que el edge puede y no puede bloquear"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:92
msgid "Zone Resources: Include, Specific zone, the domain of this site. No other zone and no account permission."
msgstr "Zone Resources: Include, Specific zone, el dominio de este sitio. Ninguna otra zona y ningún permiso de cuenta."

#. translators: 1: Cloudflare zone name, 2: plan name, 3: date and time.
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:110
msgid "Zone: %1$s, plan: %2$s. Last update: %3$s."
msgstr "Zona: %1$s, plan: %2$s. Última actualización: %3$s."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-security-updates.php:98
msgid "Security updates are on for every plugin with a known vulnerability. When a release fixes one, WordPress installs it on its own and the activity log records each step."
msgstr "Las actualizaciones de seguridad están activadas para todos los plugins con una vulnerabilidad conocida. Cuando una versión la corrige, WordPress la instala por sí solo y el registro de actividad anota cada paso."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-security-updates.php:99
msgid "Security updates are off for the plugins you did not choose one by one."
msgstr "Las actualizaciones de seguridad están desactivadas para los plugins que no elegiste uno por uno."

#. translators: %s: how long ago, e.g. "9 hours".
#: includes/admin/views/page-settings.php:325
msgid "The threat feed was last refreshed %s ago. WordPress runs scheduled tasks only when someone visits the site, so a quiet site refreshes late. Ask your host to run wp-cron.php from a server cron job every 5 to 15 minutes, and add define( 'DISABLE_WP_CRON', true ); to wp-config.php."
msgstr "La fuente de amenazas se actualizó por última vez hace %s. WordPress ejecuta las tareas programadas solo cuando alguien visita el sitio, así que un sitio con pocas visitas se actualiza tarde. Pide a tu proveedor de alojamiento que ejecute wp-cron.php con una tarea cron del servidor cada 5 a 15 minutos y añade define( 'DISABLE_WP_CRON', true ); a wp-config.php."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:138
msgid "Cloudflare is up to date. Each change is in History."
msgstr "Cloudflare está al día. Cada cambio figura en el historial."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:102
#: includes/admin/views/page-settings.php:60
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:41
msgid "Edge rules (Cloudflare)"
msgstr "Reglas edge (Cloudflare)"

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:111
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:71
msgid "Edge rules come with the live threat feed, which is off. Turn it on under Live protection, or there are no rules to place."
msgstr "Las reglas edge vienen con la fuente de amenazas en tiempo real, que está desactivada. Actívala en Protección en tiempo real, o no habrá reglas que colocar."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:119
msgid "No token is saved, so nothing is put in Cloudflare. The rules for this site can be added by hand."
msgstr "No hay ningún token guardado, así que no se coloca nada en Cloudflare. Las reglas de este sitio se pueden añadir a mano."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:151
msgid "Nothing to update: edge rules are off or no token is saved."
msgstr "Nada que actualizar: las reglas edge están desactivadas o no hay ningún token guardado."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:60
msgid "That does not look like a Cloudflare API token. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Eso no parece un token de API de Cloudflare. No se guardó nada."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:79
msgid "The plugin could not remove all of its rules from Cloudflare yet and tries again later. The token is kept until then."
msgstr "El plugin todavía no pudo quitar todas sus reglas de Cloudflare y vuelve a intentarlo más tarde. El token se conserva hasta entonces."

#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:77
msgid "The plugin removed its rules from Cloudflare."
msgstr "El plugin quitó sus reglas de Cloudflare."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated edge rule ids.
#: includes/admin/class-actions-edge-rules.php:142
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-edge-rules.php:131
msgid "These rules did not fit within the custom rule limit of the zone's plan: %s."
msgstr "Estas reglas no cabían en el límite de reglas personalizadas del plan de la zona: %s."

#. translators: %s: the login name of the account.
#: includes/class-passkeys.php:411
msgid "Lost your passkey? Ask an administrator of this site to run wp shieldwave two-factor disable %s on the server."
msgstr "¿Has perdido tu passkey? Pide a un administrador de este sitio que ejecute en el servidor wp shieldwave two-factor disable %s."

#. translators: %s: the new login address.
#: includes/admin/class-actions-login-extra.php:138
msgid "The login page is now at %s. Bookmark it and open it in a private window before you sign out. The email with this address could not be sent, so write the address down."
msgstr "La página de inicio de sesión está ahora en %s. Añádela a marcadores y ábrela en una ventana privada antes de cerrar sesión. No se pudo enviar el correo con esta dirección, así que anótala."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:35
msgid "Explicit IP blocks apply in both modes. Allowlisted addresses bypass the firewall. Cloudflare ranges are filled in by default. The country comes from CF-IPCountry when the connection is from a listed edge, or from a server GeoIP module variable. Unknown countries pass."
msgstr "Los bloqueos de IP se aplican en ambos modos. Las direcciones permitidas omiten el cortafuegos. Los rangos de Cloudflare vienen incluidos por defecto. El país se obtiene de CF-IPCountry si la conexión procede de un rango de la lista, o de una variable del módulo GeoIP del servidor. Los países desconocidos se permiten."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:40
msgid "Your own Cloudflare ranges replace the defaults. Leave the field empty to restore the default ranges."
msgstr "Tus rangos de Cloudflare sustituyen a los predeterminados. Deja el campo vacío para restaurar los rangos predeterminados."

#. translators: %s: user login.
#: includes/class-activity-events.php:125
msgid "%s signed in."
msgstr "Inicio de sesión: %s."

#: includes/class-activity-events.php:147
msgid "no role"
msgstr "sin rol"

#. translators: 1: user login, 2: role, 3: how (e.g. "a front-end request").
#: includes/class-activity-events.php:150
msgid "New account %1$s (%2$s) through %3$s."
msgstr "Nueva cuenta %1$s (rol: %2$s), origen: %3$s."

#. translators: 1: login of who made it, 2: user login, 3: role.
