#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:81
msgid "The newest 100 entries are shown. Logs stay on this site for up to 30 days and are size limited. They contain IP addresses, paths, user agents and rule IDs, never passwords or submitted values."
msgstr "Se muestran las últimas 100 entradas. El registro permanece en este sitio hasta 30 días, con tamaño limitado. Incluye IP, rutas, agentes de usuario e identificadores de reglas, nunca contraseñas ni valores enviados."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:82
msgid "Time"
msgstr "Hora"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:52
msgid "To recover access, set SHIELDWAVE_FIREWALL_OFF to true in wp-config.php. If early loading prevents access, ask your host to replace wp-content/ensomedia-security-firewall.php with an empty PHP file and remove the marked .user.ini entry. Keep that empty file until the PHP cache expires."
msgstr "Para recuperar el acceso, establece SHIELDWAVE_FIREWALL_OFF en true en wp-config.php. Si la carga anticipada impide acceder, pide al alojamiento que sustituya wp-content/ensomedia-security-firewall.php por un archivo PHP vacío y quite la entrada marcada de .user.ini. Conserva el archivo vacío hasta que caduque la caché PHP."

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:57
#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:62
msgid "Scoped exceptions"
msgstr "Excepciones específicas"

#: includes/admin/views/partials/settings-firewall.php:68
